//! The callback receives each module/name, its hygienic type path, capture direction override,
//! round-trip candidate rank, and field-dump admission. `auto` uses the opcode table's direction;
//! `both` admits either direction without consulting that table. `skip` excludes an adapter.
//! Candidate ranks order alternate bodies of the same opcode, not messages of different opcodes.
//! The opaque envelope is separate because capture decoding supplies its own structured reader.

